WEBVTT

01:25.770 --> 01:31.610
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.220 --> 01:39.580
[Episode 36: As If We Meet Again]

01:41.340 --> 01:42.576
Nandu reported that

01:42.600 --> 01:44.046
Su’s over 20 storehouses

01:44.070 --> 01:45.630
were burned to the ground.

01:45.750 --> 01:47.366
The arsonist was Su Mingyu.

01:47.390 --> 01:48.466
He has escaped.

01:48.490 --> 01:50.060
He is now a wanted man.

01:52.149 --> 01:54.655
Causing huge damage to oneself while trying to take down one's enemy.

01:54.679 --> 01:56.966
That's what Yuntai normally does.

01:56.990 --> 01:59.606
Su Mingyu has a good master.

01:59.630 --> 02:00.686
Not only Nandu,

02:00.710 --> 02:02.390
all military supplies in neighboring provinces

02:02.390 --> 02:03.840
have been bought out.

02:04.220 --> 02:07.506
We can only go to the rural north to look for supplies.

02:07.530 --> 02:08.936
Go make the deployment.

02:08.960 --> 02:10.410
Yes.

02:10.800 --> 02:12.250
Your Highness.

02:13.210 --> 02:14.176
Your Highness.

02:14.200 --> 02:15.176
I just received the news

02:15.200 --> 02:16.980
that Master Kou has been killed

02:17.000 --> 02:18.450
by Yun Xiang and Kou Lianyi.

02:19.700 --> 02:20.646
Also,

02:20.670 --> 02:21.996
Lord Nangong's tomb is empty.

02:22.020 --> 02:23.246
It's suspected that he's faking his death.

02:23.270 --> 02:26.560
Young Yun Xiang and Kou Lianyi have brought him down the mountain.

02:29.430 --> 02:31.276
Where are they now?

02:31.300 --> 02:32.816
We haven't found them yet.

02:32.840 --> 02:34.116
Keep investigating.

02:34.140 --> 02:35.590
Yes.

02:38.540 --> 02:41.210
The mastermind of Yuntai is brilliant.

02:42.390 --> 02:43.460
In the end,

02:43.480 --> 02:46.410
the disciple laid out traps for their master instead.

02:51.430 --> 02:52.736
Fine.

02:52.760 --> 02:54.406
The direct disciple.

02:54.430 --> 02:56.270
They match each other.

02:59.710 --> 03:02.420
I wonder if this is good or bad.

03:03.230 --> 03:04.936
Yun Xiang is naturally gifted.

03:04.960 --> 03:06.276
But I don't understand

03:06.300 --> 03:08.200
why he would abduct Nangong Fang.

03:10.510 --> 03:13.750
They have a deep grudge.

03:14.980 --> 03:18.320
He has been hiding his identity for more than ten years

03:18.590 --> 03:21.060
to seek revenge.

03:27.510 --> 03:28.310
But if he wants revenge,

03:28.310 --> 03:30.340
he can just kill Nangong Fang.

03:33.940 --> 03:35.650
Why did he kidnap him?

04:00.670 --> 04:02.540
Where is Kou Lianyi?

04:03.600 --> 04:05.270
Give her to me.

04:06.470 --> 04:09.630
I'll tell you everything you ask.

04:09.670 --> 04:11.566
You harassed Miss Kou first.

04:11.590 --> 04:14.910
You brought this upon yourself.

04:15.270 --> 04:15.909
What you should think about now

04:15.909 --> 04:18.350
is how to save your own life.

04:20.330 --> 04:22.770
Prince Fu's plan to use Lingyuan's chaos

04:23.900 --> 04:25.386
has been disintegrated.

04:25.410 --> 04:27.000
After the incident,

04:27.230 --> 04:29.670
Prince Fu was planning to take Nandu.

04:30.870 --> 04:33.710
But he couldn't do it.

04:34.020 --> 04:35.946
The garrison supplies in the city

04:35.970 --> 04:37.780
have been burned down.

04:38.940 --> 04:41.556
Nandu now is but an empty town.

04:41.580 --> 04:43.646
The only people Prince Fu can rely on now

04:43.670 --> 04:45.310
are the pirates.

04:45.990 --> 04:49.430
You've been in contact with Master Guan, right?

04:51.640 --> 04:53.960
Is this why you and Kou Lianyi

04:54.000 --> 04:57.189
went through so much to kidnap me here?

04:58.570 --> 05:00.890
Stop mentioning Miss Kou.

05:01.380 --> 05:02.830
Nangong Fang,

05:03.650 --> 05:05.906
if you tell us the plan of the bandits,

05:05.930 --> 05:08.290
the imperial court will be lenient to you.

05:11.260 --> 05:12.880
If I tell you,

05:13.280 --> 05:15.560
how can I survive?

05:15.710 --> 05:17.910
Why don't you let me go?

05:18.040 --> 05:19.920
When I see Master Guan,

05:20.360 --> 05:22.770
I could persuade him to retreat.

05:25.640 --> 05:27.600
Isn't my state right now

05:28.030 --> 05:30.750
what you want to see anyway?

05:36.190 --> 05:37.640
My lord.

05:40.030 --> 05:41.476
Tell him.

05:41.500 --> 05:42.926
Yes.

05:42.950 --> 05:45.316
Eunuch Liu just returned from the coastal defense.

05:45.340 --> 05:47.596
The bandits tried to attack the wharf the night before.

05:47.620 --> 05:49.525
Fortunately, the coastal defense had taken precautions.

05:49.549 --> 05:51.520
The bandits retreated without fighting.

05:51.940 --> 05:54.150
It means it's useless to keep him alive.

05:56.299 --> 05:58.460
If this is true,

05:59.540 --> 06:01.380
just kill me.

06:13.430 --> 06:16.590
You've solved the urgent matter.

06:16.740 --> 06:20.070
It's all thanks to Your Majesty's timely dispatch.

06:20.410 --> 06:22.126
At this critical period,

06:22.150 --> 06:24.886
I hope you won't just report the good news and not the bad.

06:24.910 --> 06:26.630
Don't be rude in front of Her Highness.

06:27.640 --> 06:29.090
Just speak your mind.

06:29.350 --> 06:31.100
The bandits retreated without a fight.

06:31.560 --> 06:33.840
There must be a conspiracy behind it.

06:33.990 --> 06:35.006
Young Master Xiang,

06:35.030 --> 06:36.870
please don't hold back what you say.

06:37.910 --> 06:38.976
Your Highness,

06:39.000 --> 06:40.486
since the bandits are working with Fu Fan,

06:40.510 --> 06:42.646
they must be ready to risk their lives.

06:42.670 --> 06:45.230
They won't give up without even trying.

06:45.520 --> 06:47.606
It is said that the bandits

06:47.630 --> 06:51.506
have gathered at Guiyu Island.

06:51.530 --> 06:52.836
How many warships are there?

06:52.860 --> 06:54.740
There are over

06:55.520 --> 06:57.950
500 warships.

07:02.080 --> 07:03.966
His Majesty is ill.

07:03.990 --> 07:06.446
The situation in the court is already unstable.

07:06.470 --> 07:08.716
In addition to that, the north border is in chaos.

07:08.740 --> 07:11.056
The elites of the North leaving town.

07:11.080 --> 07:13.480
If the bandits go on to stir up the south...

07:15.210 --> 07:17.540
How can Fu Fan be so vicious?

07:17.790 --> 07:19.496
With a situation like this,

07:19.520 --> 07:21.520
I haven't been able to sleep in days.

07:22.180 --> 07:24.100
Do you have any good ideas?

07:32.299 --> 07:34.290
I'm injured.

07:34.410 --> 07:36.480
I can't kneel and bow.

07:36.549 --> 07:38.430
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

07:39.430 --> 07:40.880
No need.

07:41.220 --> 07:43.189
Aren't you going to thank Her Majesty?

07:43.270 --> 07:47.106
I heard that you failed to attack Master Guan at night

07:47.130 --> 07:48.710
and has retreated.

07:48.740 --> 07:50.190
In that case,

07:50.510 --> 07:52.750
why did you come here?

07:52.910 --> 07:54.670
Although the night raid failed,

07:55.030 --> 07:56.446
the pirate ship

07:56.470 --> 07:59.350
is still far better than the Navy in the southeast.

07:59.820 --> 08:01.576
If they attack us,

08:01.600 --> 08:03.560
the result is still uncertain.

08:03.670 --> 08:06.670
But if the government deploys the Navy from the north to cause chaos,

08:07.230 --> 08:11.680
the bandits will take advantage of the chance to go north to take the Beidu.

08:12.310 --> 08:13.760
Is that right?

08:16.030 --> 08:19.310
Yun Xiang knows me well.

08:19.480 --> 08:23.150
Yun Xiang said that you must have a backup plan.

08:23.300 --> 08:27.060
Perhaps you're the only one who can stop the bandits from attacking.

08:27.150 --> 08:29.270
Although you are a criminal,

08:29.390 --> 08:31.156
but if you make such a great contribution,

08:31.180 --> 08:33.446
I'll guarantee you a promotion

08:33.470 --> 08:35.136
and be rich for hundreds of years.

08:35.160 --> 08:37.680
Be rich for hundreds of years?

08:43.500 --> 08:45.940
I have to see what would happen in this chaotic world.

08:46.240 --> 08:47.736
How dare you!

08:47.760 --> 08:49.210
You...

08:50.590 --> 08:53.350
Now I'm a cripple.

08:54.470 --> 08:56.650
I have no offspring.

08:57.520 --> 08:59.366
What is hundreds of years to me?

08:59.390 --> 09:02.196
Then let me hear your thoughts.

09:02.220 --> 09:03.700
It's simple.

09:04.580 --> 09:06.380
Give me a speedboat.

09:06.500 --> 09:08.540
I'll meet Master Guan

09:08.930 --> 09:10.306
and persuade him to retreat.

09:10.330 --> 09:11.870
No way.

09:11.930 --> 09:13.916
If we let you leave now,

09:13.940 --> 09:16.460
with your mouth,

09:16.560 --> 09:19.810
who knows what you'd say when the time comes?

09:20.160 --> 09:21.800
Either let me go,

09:22.310 --> 09:24.930
or kill me.

09:25.070 --> 09:27.080
Yun Xiang is here.

09:29.540 --> 09:30.990
Your Highness.

09:31.240 --> 09:33.270
Your Highness, don't trust him.

09:33.390 --> 09:36.506
At this point, why not give it a try?

09:36.530 --> 09:37.980
I could have tried.

09:38.230 --> 09:39.680
However,

09:40.930 --> 09:44.086
you didn't listen to my advice

09:44.110 --> 09:45.590
and lowered yourself to come here.

09:45.830 --> 09:48.910
This can't be tried anymore.

09:49.530 --> 09:51.200
I lowered myself

09:51.250 --> 09:54.320
to save the people.

09:54.950 --> 09:57.216
Your Highness just revealed

09:57.240 --> 09:58.690
your feelings.

09:59.230 --> 10:01.366
If we let him go to see Master Guan,

10:01.390 --> 10:05.590
it will only make the bandits come faster and become more ruthless.

10:08.410 --> 10:09.860
You may leave.

10:10.350 --> 10:11.046
Your Highness.

10:11.070 --> 10:14.270
I asked if you have any good ideas, and you couldn't reply.

10:14.390 --> 10:17.260
Yet you're pointing fingers at what I want to do.

10:17.680 --> 10:20.830
You keep saying you care about the people.

10:21.020 --> 10:23.110
But you don't want to let him go.

10:23.430 --> 10:25.550
I'm afraid it's for your personal grudge.

10:26.230 --> 10:30.286
I didn't expect Your Highness to think of me so lowly.

10:30.310 --> 10:31.516
Eunuch Liu.

10:31.540 --> 10:32.126
Yes, Your Majesty.

10:32.150 --> 10:34.910
I'm afraid Young Master didn't understand me.

10:38.190 --> 10:39.266
Yun Xiang.

10:39.290 --> 10:41.366
You should leave now.

10:41.390 --> 10:44.150
Don't make Her Highness angry again.

10:56.730 --> 10:58.670
Her Highness said...

10:59.250 --> 11:02.580
Yun Xiang wouldn't let me go because of his personal grudge.

11:03.390 --> 11:05.260
But after thinking about it,

11:06.750 --> 11:09.680
I don't know since when I have a deep grudge with him.

11:09.710 --> 11:12.446
Are you really willing to persuade the bandits to retreat?

11:12.470 --> 11:13.920
Your Highness.

11:14.550 --> 11:16.680
What do you mean

11:19.960 --> 11:21.570
by the personal grudge Yun Xiang has?

11:42.950 --> 11:45.410
How do you think

11:46.690 --> 11:48.750
I will persuade Master Guan when I see him this time?

11:50.590 --> 11:52.830
Actually, I didn't expect this at all.

11:52.870 --> 11:54.830
When I saw you for a few times previously,

11:54.870 --> 11:57.390
it did seem like you were hiding something under your eyes.

11:58.670 --> 12:00.210
So your surname is Luo?

12:10.740 --> 12:14.600
I will take your life sooner or later.

12:21.230 --> 12:24.726
Now I've escaped again.

12:24.750 --> 12:27.450
We don't know who will take

12:29.420 --> 12:31.490
whose life in the future.

12:52.100 --> 12:53.550
Let's go.

13:11.190 --> 13:12.640
I didn't expect

13:12.680 --> 13:15.556
we could persuade Her Highness to put on an act together

13:15.580 --> 13:17.016
and let Nangong Fang go?

13:17.040 --> 13:19.726
We can only take the risk now.

13:19.750 --> 13:21.276
If you're wrong,

13:21.300 --> 13:24.426
and he really instigates Master Guan to attack,

13:24.450 --> 13:25.686
what would you do?

13:25.710 --> 13:26.896
You still don't trust me.

13:26.920 --> 13:28.560
I don't like gambling.

13:28.630 --> 13:30.110
Neither do I.

13:30.710 --> 13:32.160
But I like winning.

13:37.210 --> 13:39.260
But after he leaves this time round,

13:39.470 --> 13:42.530
I'm afraid you won't have a chance to revenge anymore.

13:47.660 --> 13:49.216
Can you people from Yuntai

13:49.240 --> 13:51.730
really hide their grudges?

13:52.590 --> 13:55.630
I'm not hiding it. I'm letting it go.

13:57.440 --> 13:58.990
Killing Nangong Fang

13:59.750 --> 14:01.750
can help me get over my own personal grudge.

14:02.490 --> 14:03.966
But leaving Nangong Fang

14:03.990 --> 14:06.030
and letting him play a game of chess with me

14:06.110 --> 14:08.470
can help save the lives of the people.

14:08.740 --> 14:10.550
Isn't it more worth it?

14:29.500 --> 14:35.070
[Shao’s Residence]

14:34.870 --> 14:37.110
How much provisions do we have?

14:38.060 --> 14:39.406
Not even enough for half a month.

14:39.430 --> 14:41.150
Take him away and behead him.

14:41.170 --> 14:43.966
Spare my life, Your Highness!

14:43.990 --> 14:46.306
Spare my life, Your Highness.

14:46.330 --> 14:48.210
As you expected,

14:49.510 --> 14:52.990
Kou Lianyi disbanded all branches.

14:53.840 --> 14:56.336
Any news from Nangong Fang?

14:56.360 --> 14:57.810
No.

15:12.630 --> 15:15.016
It's another victory within risks.

15:15.040 --> 15:17.080
We actually turned the tide.

15:17.230 --> 15:18.870
Yet I have no idea anymore.

15:28.020 --> 15:29.470
Your Highness.

15:30.540 --> 15:33.420
Turning the tide?

15:36.110 --> 15:39.230
Yun Xiang took Nangong Fang who pretended to be dead.

15:40.350 --> 15:43.470
He must have figured out my next move.

15:48.020 --> 15:50.870
Take money to see Master Guan.

15:52.000 --> 15:54.510
We can't let this rascal have any chance.

15:54.590 --> 15:56.270
The alliance

15:57.430 --> 15:59.480
can't be taken lightly.

16:01.870 --> 16:03.596
I heard that these were sent

16:03.620 --> 16:05.216
by Prince Fu from Yangzhou.

16:05.240 --> 16:06.446
Is this a rebellion?

16:06.470 --> 16:07.076
Exactly.

16:07.100 --> 16:08.296
It's been less than half a month,

16:08.320 --> 16:10.366
and Nandu has completely changed.

16:10.390 --> 16:11.546
The city gate is closed too.

16:11.570 --> 16:13.730
We can't escape even if we want to.

16:18.290 --> 16:19.740
Come out.

16:24.390 --> 16:25.840
Your Highness, please forgive me.

16:26.220 --> 16:28.030
I've been following orders.

16:28.190 --> 16:30.606
But at this critical moment,

16:30.630 --> 16:32.740
why did Your Highness come out alone?

16:33.660 --> 16:35.940
If I don't do this, how can I lure you out?

16:48.880 --> 16:50.900
Nandu is not safe now.

16:52.170 --> 16:55.920
Please don't go out alone.

16:57.040 --> 16:58.680
What are you afraid of?

17:05.910 --> 17:08.350
Actually, it's... It's me.

17:08.350 --> 17:09.800
Mingzhu.

17:10.590 --> 17:13.190
From now on, you shall stay here.

17:13.820 --> 17:15.879
I can ensure your safety.

17:17.190 --> 17:18.640
Uncle,

17:19.209 --> 17:20.796
I've never begged you.

17:20.820 --> 17:23.070
Have you ever cared about my father?

17:23.479 --> 17:25.099
Can you let my father go?

17:29.190 --> 17:31.270
Even if it's not for my father,

17:31.960 --> 17:33.760
but for me?

17:34.500 --> 17:36.380
I can't do as you say.

17:36.630 --> 17:39.340
His Highness is on his way to hell.

17:40.070 --> 17:42.390
I can only protect you

17:42.530 --> 17:44.610
if you stay here.

17:58.860 --> 18:00.310
Let go.

18:02.250 --> 18:03.396
Let go!

18:03.420 --> 18:05.740
- Let go!
- I used to obey you.

18:06.260 --> 18:10.490
But today, I can't let you be willful anymore.

18:11.450 --> 18:13.246
You've never treated me like this before.

18:13.270 --> 18:15.560
Do you know what it means to go back?

18:15.950 --> 18:18.100
I can't persuade His Highness.

18:19.900 --> 18:22.700
I can't watch you

18:24.150 --> 18:26.510
walk to the end of the day too.

18:30.590 --> 18:33.300
Are you really going to be so cruel to my father?

18:33.780 --> 18:36.540
Don't you care about kinship at all?

18:52.270 --> 18:54.820
His Highness treated me so well.

18:56.470 --> 18:58.530
How can I bear to do that?

19:01.200 --> 19:03.350
But this matter concerns the people.

19:03.350 --> 19:04.990
Yet His Highness...

19:09.660 --> 19:11.380
is indeed in the wrong.

19:12.790 --> 19:15.430
Did the people take you in?

19:16.000 --> 19:19.110
Have the people ever treated you well?

19:20.160 --> 19:23.120
I trusted you so much since childhood.

19:23.740 --> 19:26.310
I thought you'd hurt anyone but me.

19:27.500 --> 19:29.750
I'm not letting you leave today

19:31.030 --> 19:32.740
is to protect you.

19:34.450 --> 19:35.900
Your Highness!

19:43.020 --> 19:46.360
I won't blame you if you refuse.

19:48.010 --> 19:50.560
But I will never let my father be alone.

19:53.070 --> 19:55.050
Whether I'm alive or dead,

19:55.810 --> 19:58.130
I want to be with my father.

20:03.790 --> 20:05.240
Just think that

20:06.980 --> 20:09.010
I've never been here before.

20:22.870 --> 20:24.800
The pursuers came so fast.

20:26.450 --> 20:28.530
We have nowhere to run.

20:32.480 --> 20:34.200
I don't want to drag you down anymore.

20:34.930 --> 20:36.446
Zhushan Street should be safe.

20:36.470 --> 20:37.920
It's right ahead.

20:39.510 --> 20:40.960
I can't take it anymore.

20:42.260 --> 20:43.710
Where do you think you're going?

20:46.350 --> 20:48.330
You go first. I'll handle this.

20:48.460 --> 20:49.626
Mingyu!

20:49.650 --> 20:50.926
Run!

20:50.950 --> 20:52.400
Go!

21:13.890 --> 21:15.340
Stop!

21:19.240 --> 21:20.690
Stop!

21:21.470 --> 21:22.920
Stop!

21:23.870 --> 21:25.320
Stop!

21:26.590 --> 21:27.716
Stop!

21:27.740 --> 21:29.190
Stop!

21:31.840 --> 21:33.290
Menglan!

22:10.890 --> 22:12.570
Who dares to hurt my brother?

22:14.250 --> 22:15.426
Brother Jin!

22:15.450 --> 22:16.900
Brother Jin.

23:02.060 --> 23:03.510
The antidote works.

23:03.560 --> 23:05.006
It's 90% healed.

23:05.030 --> 23:07.460
Tell me, what do you want me to do this time?

23:08.670 --> 23:10.510
Just follow the instructions on the satchet.

23:12.350 --> 23:13.800
You're still alive.

23:14.560 --> 23:16.280
Do you dare to take me in?

23:17.450 --> 23:20.766
These are my swordsmen.

23:20.790 --> 23:22.956
I heard that someone is picking a fight with the owner of Jishan Hall.

23:22.980 --> 23:24.750
So I came without any further ado.

23:31.310 --> 23:33.596
Please take her away first.

23:33.620 --> 23:35.006
Be careful.

23:35.030 --> 23:36.480
Go!

23:38.300 --> 23:39.910
Kill them all! Go!

24:08.080 --> 24:09.530
Be careful.

24:47.750 --> 24:49.346
Mo Bufan has been killed by Prince Fu.

24:49.370 --> 24:51.260
Yet you still work for him?

25:35.450 --> 25:36.900
Uncle Qian?

25:37.390 --> 25:38.756
Sir.

25:38.780 --> 25:40.230
It's solved.

25:41.490 --> 25:42.940
Sir.

25:44.790 --> 25:46.476
Uncle Qian, why are you here?

25:46.500 --> 25:49.526
Of course it's your master, Mr. Yun's idea.

25:49.550 --> 25:50.686
Mingyu.

25:50.710 --> 25:52.600
Isn't this your residence's steward?

25:54.630 --> 25:55.676
By the way,

25:55.700 --> 25:57.966
I killed people this time.

25:57.990 --> 25:59.586
You sister will definitely scold me.

25:59.610 --> 26:03.210
So please put in a good word for me when you go back.

26:03.510 --> 26:04.960
Don't worry.

26:07.220 --> 26:08.526
Where's Yun Xiang?

26:08.100 --> 26:11.770
[Shao's Residence]

26:14.150 --> 26:15.600
I want to see Prince Fu.

26:19.600 --> 26:23.370
You came alone thinking you'd win?

26:25.550 --> 26:27.080
You have a clear mind.

26:27.550 --> 26:29.000
You have your own judgment.

26:29.250 --> 26:31.426
Do you remember last time you asked me

26:31.450 --> 26:33.260
what I would do next?

26:33.550 --> 26:35.030
I said I don't know.

26:36.030 --> 26:37.750
The so-called killing move

26:37.950 --> 26:40.230
is your only bet now.

26:44.730 --> 26:46.180
The pirates.

26:51.390 --> 26:52.176
You didn't waste

26:52.200 --> 26:54.930
the 15 years I've taught you for.

26:55.590 --> 26:58.980
I will never forget the things you've taught me.

27:01.320 --> 27:06.050
But those pirates may not come.

27:39.250 --> 27:41.236
Let’s go. Master has been waiting for you.

27:41.260 --> 27:42.710
Please.

27:58.790 --> 28:02.270
At this time, even if Xu Lang brings an entire ship of treasures

28:02.270 --> 28:03.940
to meet Master Guan,

28:04.390 --> 28:06.350
it won't help.

28:07.490 --> 28:11.210
It's just that Nangong Fang will meet Master Guan first.

28:13.270 --> 28:14.720
Come.

28:20.460 --> 28:21.566
Master Guan.

28:21.590 --> 28:22.896
Xu Lang?

28:22.920 --> 28:23.966
Have a seat.

28:23.990 --> 28:26.790
You're so generous, Your Highness.

28:29.450 --> 28:31.226
Can you persuade him

28:31.250 --> 28:33.676
to make Master Guan not deploy his men?

28:33.700 --> 28:35.126
You are the master of Yuntai.

28:35.150 --> 28:36.750
You should know that

28:36.910 --> 28:38.996
what Nangong Fang will first do

28:39.020 --> 28:40.610
after meeting Master Guan.

28:42.450 --> 28:45.096
Since Nangong Fang is with Master Guan,

28:45.120 --> 28:47.190
according to our agreement,

28:48.710 --> 28:50.630
he'd persuade him to deploy troops.

28:51.240 --> 28:52.576
I came in a hurry.

28:52.600 --> 28:54.596
I brought three ships of gold and silver.

28:54.620 --> 28:56.996
The gifts that Prince Fu prepared for you are still in the back.

28:57.020 --> 28:57.946
Master Guan.

28:57.970 --> 28:59.796
I saw the warships were assembled on my way here.

28:59.820 --> 29:02.220
But why are they all anchored at the port?

29:02.790 --> 29:04.676
His Highness has taken over Yangzhou

29:04.700 --> 29:05.956
and Nandu, these two cities.

29:05.980 --> 29:07.646
As long as you give the order,

29:07.670 --> 29:09.510
we can shift the power to us.

29:09.960 --> 29:11.830
But the moment the power has been reshuffled,

29:12.170 --> 29:16.266
the first person I want to see is Young Master Xiang.

29:16.290 --> 29:17.706
What's the use of meeting him?

29:17.730 --> 29:19.850
Can you bring back what's gone?

29:20.020 --> 29:21.566
As long as you give an order,

29:21.590 --> 29:23.386
Mr. Nangong can take revenge.

29:23.410 --> 29:24.806
After you take over the country,

29:24.830 --> 29:27.666
Master Guan and Prince Fu can divide the north and south among yourselves.

29:27.690 --> 29:29.210
There's no rush.

29:29.410 --> 29:30.846
Let me think about it.

29:30.870 --> 29:32.786
Didn't you have a deal with His Highness?

29:32.810 --> 29:35.010
This isn't a one-sided deal by him!

29:36.070 --> 29:37.606
He wanted me to dispatch hundreds of ships

29:37.630 --> 29:40.086
just for a few chests of gems?

29:40.110 --> 29:42.400
How can there be such a cheap deal?

29:45.720 --> 29:48.080
Let's talk inside.

29:48.870 --> 29:50.320
Master Guan.

29:50.410 --> 29:52.680
Who is this Xu Lang?

29:54.960 --> 29:56.880
He is Prince Fu's personal guard

29:57.510 --> 29:59.200
and right-hand man.

30:00.990 --> 30:02.720
Is he a man of his word?

30:03.020 --> 30:04.766
How many bargaining chips

30:04.790 --> 30:06.486
can I get with what you taught me?

30:06.510 --> 30:09.150
Prince Fu and him are the ones in a hurry.

30:10.510 --> 30:12.790
You can ask for the price at will.

30:13.940 --> 30:15.390
But in my opinion,

30:15.390 --> 30:17.360
this is not that simple.

30:19.620 --> 30:20.486
What do you mean?

30:20.510 --> 30:25.060
After careful consideration, I found something amiss.

30:26.510 --> 30:27.960
First,

30:28.350 --> 30:30.566
I have a grudge against Yun Xiang.

30:30.590 --> 30:32.810
With his rigorous personality,

30:33.150 --> 30:35.530
it doesn't make sense that he'd let go of his hatred

30:36.290 --> 30:38.006
and send me across the sea.

30:38.030 --> 30:39.086
Second,

30:39.110 --> 30:42.406
the southwest coastal defense has always been fictional.

30:42.430 --> 30:44.350
If anyone were to attack,

30:44.480 --> 30:46.600
the guards will be defeated.

30:46.630 --> 30:49.900
How could Yun Xiang not know about this?

30:49.960 --> 30:51.496
He must have predicted that...

30:51.520 --> 30:53.240
even if he killed me,

30:55.110 --> 30:57.070
you may not send troops.

30:57.950 --> 31:00.190
But he just had to let me go.

31:02.700 --> 31:04.216
As we agreed,

31:04.240 --> 31:05.526
it's not difficult

31:05.550 --> 31:07.526
to persuade him to send troops.

31:07.550 --> 31:12.470
Besides, it's beneficial to him.

31:14.020 --> 31:15.470
That's right.

31:16.070 --> 31:18.480
So before Nangong Fang was released to cross the sea,

31:18.580 --> 31:22.390
I begged Her Majesty to put on a show with me.

31:23.630 --> 31:25.966
If we want to be even more sure about this,

31:25.990 --> 31:29.310
we need Your Highness to follow our plan.

31:29.390 --> 31:30.326
Could we?

31:30.350 --> 31:32.246
Since you two have made up your mind,

31:32.270 --> 31:33.830
I believe you.

31:33.870 --> 31:37.120
Nangong Fang volunteered

31:37.690 --> 31:39.570
to ask the bandits to retreat.

31:39.650 --> 31:41.836
I have a blood feud with him.

31:41.860 --> 31:43.450
I can't let him go.

31:43.510 --> 31:44.630
But I didn't expect Her Majesty

31:44.630 --> 31:46.430
to not listen to my advice

31:46.770 --> 31:48.910
and insisted on letting Nangong Fang go across the sea.

31:49.550 --> 31:51.750
It's reasonable.

31:52.080 --> 31:54.200
But too reasonable.

31:54.650 --> 31:57.460
For someone as skeptical as Nangong Fang,

31:57.670 --> 31:59.986
I'm sure he'll think there's something fishy about this.

32:00.010 --> 32:02.530
Yun Xiang really thinks highly of himself.

32:03.430 --> 32:04.876
Actually, his acting with the Empress

32:04.900 --> 32:06.476
was so fake.

32:06.500 --> 32:08.650
He really thought I couldn't see through it?

32:10.360 --> 32:12.596
He let me cross the sea for only one purpose.

32:12.620 --> 32:15.360
It is for me to persuade you to send your troops as support

32:15.780 --> 32:18.740
in the name of revenge.

32:21.900 --> 32:23.326
What?

32:23.350 --> 32:25.756
He wants to lure me out instead?

32:25.780 --> 32:27.136
That's right.

32:27.160 --> 32:28.630
He must have joined forces with the court

32:28.650 --> 32:30.570
and is fully prepared.

32:31.110 --> 32:32.820
Once you dispatch the troops,

32:33.270 --> 32:35.590
he will capture the both of us.

32:35.630 --> 32:39.426
In that case, Yun Xiang's want to make me to deploy my troops

32:39.450 --> 32:42.500
is a trap that he has set for me to step into?

32:43.150 --> 32:45.040
And now Xu Lang is here

32:46.020 --> 32:48.120
to get me killed?

32:54.470 --> 32:56.200
Why should I believe you?

32:59.250 --> 33:02.420
Actually, it's simple.

33:02.910 --> 33:04.710
Because only I

33:05.510 --> 33:07.550
want you to win.

33:07.610 --> 33:09.180
Only if you win,

33:09.780 --> 33:11.420
can I take revenge.

33:11.830 --> 33:14.740
Lord Fu only worries about himself.

33:15.180 --> 33:17.446
In his eyes, your pirates

33:17.470 --> 33:19.966
are of no difference with the dead soldiers at Lingyuan.

33:19.990 --> 33:21.740
Even if he has the throne,

33:23.940 --> 33:25.480
it's still his.

33:28.980 --> 33:30.536
It's none of your business.

33:30.560 --> 33:35.046
I tried every means to keep Nangong Fang alive

33:35.070 --> 33:37.270
because I was afraid that if he really died,

33:37.550 --> 33:39.670
you'll be the one who meets Master Guan.

33:40.530 --> 33:42.300
What would you do?

33:42.550 --> 33:43.766
Entice him with great interests again?

33:43.790 --> 33:45.996
What would Master Guan choose?

33:46.020 --> 33:47.470
No one knows.

33:47.660 --> 33:49.980
So in order to get those pirates to retreat,

33:50.150 --> 33:53.970
Nangong Fang is the only move we can make.

33:59.460 --> 34:01.410
When I was shut in,

34:01.590 --> 34:04.170
I thought I was testing you.

34:05.630 --> 34:08.810
I didn't expect you to set me up.

34:12.279 --> 34:15.459
Then Nangong Fang would think

34:15.930 --> 34:19.180
I deliberately used him to lure the pirates to send troops

34:19.240 --> 34:21.400
while the court is waiting for him with assembled troops,

34:21.470 --> 34:23.350
that I am trying to capture all of them in one go.

34:24.589 --> 34:26.260
What do you think

34:26.740 --> 34:28.660
of my acting?

34:30.910 --> 34:32.390
The empty city plan?

34:33.220 --> 34:35.956
But Nangong Fang may not be a Sima Yi.

34:35.980 --> 34:39.140
In terms of practice, you and him are neck and neck.

34:39.549 --> 34:41.636
Your trap in a trap, the empty city trap,

34:41.660 --> 34:44.820
how can you be sure that Nangong Fang can't see through it?

34:45.260 --> 34:47.126
It doesn't matter

34:47.150 --> 34:48.630
if he can see through it.

34:49.100 --> 34:51.010
Why don't you ask Sima Yi?

34:51.069 --> 34:52.939
If he can go back in time,

34:53.730 --> 34:56.880
give him another 100 chances to lead the army to attack the city,

34:57.670 --> 34:59.280
will he have the courage to do so?

35:00.180 --> 35:03.100
Humanity and a human heart,

35:03.830 --> 35:05.520
in troubled times,

35:06.410 --> 35:09.320
there are only worries.

35:11.110 --> 35:12.560
You taught me that.

35:28.480 --> 35:30.570
It’s said that Zhuge had so many tricks up his sleeves he's basically a demon.

35:32.210 --> 35:34.980
You're worse than that.

35:36.120 --> 35:38.210
You've become a demon.

35:43.610 --> 35:45.060
Master Guan.

35:45.430 --> 35:46.526
When will you give the order?

35:46.550 --> 35:48.030
So I can explain to His Highness.

35:49.020 --> 35:50.470
Now.

35:50.630 --> 35:51.170
Arrest him.

35:51.190 --> 35:52.640
Yes.

35:52.870 --> 35:54.726
Master Guan, what do you mean?

35:54.750 --> 35:56.200
Take him away.

35:57.120 --> 35:59.520
Master Guan! Master Guan!

36:00.110 --> 36:01.366
Let go!

36:01.390 --> 36:03.220
There's a long way to go.

36:03.400 --> 36:05.520
With you as my counsellor,

36:05.750 --> 36:08.110
we can just find another chance.

36:11.870 --> 36:15.206
What should we do with him then?

36:15.230 --> 36:16.740
The thief never leaves empty.

36:17.060 --> 36:19.180
I made a deal with the government

36:19.830 --> 36:21.350
for several islands.

36:25.150 --> 36:26.600
Yun Xiang.

36:27.410 --> 36:30.170
You could have helped me

36:31.300 --> 36:33.020
and achieved great cause.

36:33.190 --> 36:35.990
But why did you break your promise?

36:36.030 --> 36:39.150
I just want to reshuffle the power

36:39.170 --> 36:41.610
and bring peace to the world.

36:41.790 --> 36:45.230
But you're the one who ruined my effort.

36:45.270 --> 36:48.950
You're my most trusted disciple.

36:49.740 --> 36:51.236
In the way of Yuntai,

36:51.260 --> 36:52.940
one house is akin to the world,

36:53.300 --> 36:54.910
and one person is akin to the entire population.

36:55.310 --> 36:57.030
But I want to ask

36:57.300 --> 37:00.510
have you ever pitied the people?

37:05.960 --> 37:09.600
I'm not the one who betrayed you.

37:12.520 --> 37:17.180
Now you want to unify the world, is just pure daydreaming.

37:18.020 --> 37:21.090
With the disbandment of Lingyuan and the pirates breaking the contract,

37:22.230 --> 37:26.350
Nandu has already become an isolated city.

37:26.390 --> 37:29.720
The provisions in the city can barely hold out for half a month.

37:31.020 --> 37:32.730
How can you continue?

37:37.290 --> 37:39.310
Since we are master and disciple,

37:39.640 --> 37:43.040
let's leave some dignity for each other.

38:00.670 --> 38:02.120
Forget it.

38:04.270 --> 38:05.576
I admit defeat.

38:05.600 --> 38:07.560
But I have one condition.

38:10.170 --> 38:14.370
Otherwise, I'll risk my life.

38:14.450 --> 38:17.640
I'll do anything even if I have to risk everything I have.

38:29.020 --> 38:30.470
How is it?

38:34.350 --> 38:35.880
Congratulations, Your Majesty.

38:35.940 --> 38:38.810
Congratulations to the people of Nandu.

38:48.460 --> 38:49.950
It's so quiet.

38:51.510 --> 38:53.450
Do you blame me?

38:53.690 --> 38:56.186
I just thought of my mother.

38:56.210 --> 38:57.900
After she left,

38:58.650 --> 39:00.670
we all went to Yangzhou.

39:01.430 --> 39:03.540
But I often dreamed that

39:05.150 --> 39:07.180
we went back to Nandu.

39:08.250 --> 39:10.610
The three of us are still together.

40:05.560 --> 40:09.120
[One month later]

40:16.910 --> 40:18.460
Your Majesty.

40:19.020 --> 40:21.710
His Majesty has ascended the throne.

40:21.900 --> 40:24.786
Now the world is peaceful.

40:24.810 --> 40:26.196
In the Beidu Palace,

40:26.220 --> 40:27.486
everyone

40:27.510 --> 40:30.660
is looking forward to your return.

40:31.920 --> 40:34.320
Everyone calls Jiangnan a good place.

40:34.450 --> 40:36.700
I'm in Beidu most of my time.

40:36.860 --> 40:38.190
I wanted to watch the birds and butterflies of Jiangnan

40:38.190 --> 40:40.990
for a few more days.

40:41.690 --> 40:43.430
Your Highness is right.

40:43.710 --> 40:46.236
Now that the empire is safe,

40:46.260 --> 40:48.596
even the sound of the sea birds

40:48.620 --> 40:51.810
has become more beautiful.

40:58.510 --> 40:59.960
Lord Liu.

41:01.350 --> 41:01.986
Yes, Your Majesty.

41:02.010 --> 41:05.266
Now the rebellion has been pacified and the world has been settled.

41:05.290 --> 41:07.170
You two have contributed a lot.

41:07.580 --> 41:09.676
I'll promote you.

41:09.700 --> 41:12.370
How is a title of a nobility?

41:12.900 --> 41:14.830
Thank you, Your Highness.

41:15.390 --> 41:17.110
But please forgive me, Your Highness.

41:17.560 --> 41:19.656
That's not my ambition.

41:19.680 --> 41:21.676
Although the rebellion has been pacified,

41:21.700 --> 41:23.350
the sea is still unstable.

41:24.350 --> 41:26.946
I would like to volunteer to guard the coasts

41:26.970 --> 41:28.376
to strengthen our territory

41:28.400 --> 41:30.840
and share the burden of His and Her Majesty.

41:32.140 --> 41:34.276
Lord Liu, you are so thoughtful.

41:34.300 --> 41:36.616
This is such an honor for our court.

41:36.640 --> 41:38.780
How can I not fulfill it?

41:39.070 --> 41:40.520
Thank you, Your Majesty.

41:41.450 --> 41:44.530
What about you, Young Master Xiang?

41:46.350 --> 41:47.456
Your Highness,

41:47.480 --> 41:49.196
the coastal defense

41:49.220 --> 41:51.276
still has the threat of Nangong Fang.

41:51.300 --> 41:53.136
I'm willing to help Lord Liu

41:53.160 --> 41:56.280
and make our coast as strong as possible.

42:00.850 --> 42:02.300
Good.

42:02.530 --> 42:05.236
All the land in the world belongs to the emperor.

42:05.260 --> 42:07.890
All the people in the land are royals.

42:07.950 --> 42:09.736
With the costal defense in the hands of you two,

42:09.760 --> 42:12.690
His Majesty and I will be at ease.

42:25.910 --> 42:27.360
Here.

42:34.390 --> 42:35.956
If you hadn't reminded me,

42:35.980 --> 42:38.770
I wouldn't have thought of such a good way to escape.

42:40.330 --> 42:44.350
Since ancient times, those who have achieved commendable results won't have a good ending.

42:44.730 --> 42:46.146
Just stay away from places where troubles occur

42:46.170 --> 42:47.650
and hope for the best.

42:48.720 --> 42:51.040
With you guarding the coast,

42:51.070 --> 42:52.670
I can rest assured.

42:52.960 --> 42:53.976
That's just empty words.

42:54.000 --> 42:55.770
I didn't promise you I'd go.

42:57.950 --> 42:59.026
You're going back on your words?

42:59.050 --> 42:59.876
I'm going back on my words?

42:59.900 --> 43:01.256
Young Master Xiang,

43:01.280 --> 43:03.626
I respect you as a swordsman and a confidant.

43:03.650 --> 43:05.580
You can't go back on your word.

43:05.750 --> 43:09.030
The swordsmen portrayed in novels are not real.

43:09.270 --> 43:10.720
You can't trust it.

43:10.950 --> 43:12.896
If you really think of me as your confidant,

43:12.920 --> 43:14.460
don't make it difficult for me anymore.

43:25.170 --> 43:27.800
How about this?

43:27.880 --> 43:29.560
I'll go with you if you win.

43:29.600 --> 43:30.826
If you lose,

43:30.850 --> 43:32.480
don't mention it again.

43:33.510 --> 43:34.416
Are you bullying me?

43:34.440 --> 43:35.486
I dare not.

43:35.510 --> 43:36.750
I said I don't like gambling

43:36.750 --> 43:38.870
but I never said I couldn't win.

43:42.590 --> 43:43.750
Let's play dice.

43:43.750 --> 43:45.500
Just one game.

43:45.580 --> 43:47.030
Sure.

44:14.500 --> 44:17.570
- Why don’t you–
- I don’t know when we will meet again after we part today.

44:18.180 --> 44:20.540
If I need your help in the future,

44:21.230 --> 44:23.110
I hope you won't forget

44:23.960 --> 44:25.630
our promise.

44:28.010 --> 44:29.460
Fine.

44:29.750 --> 44:31.200
Return me my dice.

44:32.110 --> 44:33.560
This shall be the evidence.

44:43.790 --> 44:48.670
[Liansheng House]

44:53.930 --> 44:55.126
See?

44:55.150 --> 44:57.396
This is called looking forward to something

44:57.420 --> 44:59.140
and being unable to wait for it.

44:59.900 --> 45:01.790
I understand, I understand.

45:02.150 --> 45:04.096
Longing makes one day feel like

45:04.120 --> 45:05.396
three years.

45:05.420 --> 45:07.096
Besides,

45:07.120 --> 45:09.580
you just experienced life and death.

45:11.150 --> 45:12.546
You're so salty.

45:12.570 --> 45:14.090
Just tell me if you're jealous.

45:15.690 --> 45:16.586
Mingyu,

45:16.610 --> 45:18.566
it's all thanks to you this time,

45:18.590 --> 45:20.556
for willing to live and die with me,

45:20.580 --> 45:22.750
and giving up all your family wealth.

45:22.910 --> 45:24.696
But for the Su family,

45:24.720 --> 45:26.540
the price is too high.

45:27.710 --> 45:30.150
Although I'm not as ambitious as you,

45:30.640 --> 45:33.720
Nandu is a place where I was born and raised.

45:33.870 --> 45:36.446
How can I watch it suffer in war?

45:36.470 --> 45:37.556
You brat.

45:37.580 --> 45:39.066
Don't be flattered just by a mere few words of his.

45:39.090 --> 45:41.370
Don't forget how he used us before.

45:41.830 --> 45:43.280
Jin,

45:43.410 --> 45:47.210
I've been feeling guilty for all I have done in the past.

45:47.270 --> 45:48.910
Stop talking nonsense.

45:50.330 --> 45:51.780
Here.

45:51.980 --> 45:54.576
Let's not talk much. Let's drink.

45:54.600 --> 45:56.050
Here.

46:01.060 --> 46:03.806
When you left last time,

46:03.830 --> 46:06.410
you said we would become sworn brothers when we return.

46:06.730 --> 46:08.510
You're so longwinded.

46:09.510 --> 46:11.650
We don't need to be so old-fashioned.

46:12.100 --> 46:15.440
Just drink this up and we'll be brothers forever.

46:17.030 --> 46:18.480
Wait.

46:19.200 --> 46:22.090
You two are becoming sworn brothers without me?

46:22.650 --> 46:24.100
Count me in.

46:24.190 --> 46:25.316
Come.

46:25.340 --> 46:26.790
Here.

46:32.510 --> 46:33.960
Jin,

46:36.040 --> 46:37.510
look who's here.

47:06.300 --> 47:12.450
Thank you for your hard work for Jishan Hall.

47:18.510 --> 47:19.990
It's good that you're back.

48:05.140 --> 48:06.590
Brother Yun.

48:07.230 --> 48:09.240
Are you thinking about the past?

48:09.870 --> 48:11.266
What past?

48:11.290 --> 48:12.740
I don't remember anything.

48:13.790 --> 48:16.590
What’s your plan for your future?

48:19.920 --> 48:22.520
We'll talk about the future in the future.

48:23.790 --> 48:25.260
Just remember that

48:25.440 --> 48:29.000
there will be no more Young Master Xiang in the world.

49:00.680 --> 49:03.750
It's been a long time since I've had your cooking.

49:06.310 --> 49:09.360
What are you waiting for? Sit down and have a taste.

49:16.840 --> 49:18.290
Sister.

49:20.340 --> 49:21.790
Don't you blame me?

49:22.460 --> 49:24.076
It's rare for us

49:24.100 --> 49:26.380
to have a meal together.

49:26.540 --> 49:28.270
Why should I blame you?

49:29.230 --> 49:33.266
Today, you can enjoy your meal in peace.

49:33.290 --> 49:36.690
Once you're at peace, you won't be afraid of anything.

49:47.730 --> 49:49.180
Yun Xiang.

49:50.380 --> 49:52.570
Do you know what it means for you

49:53.240 --> 49:54.700
to take this path?

49:55.550 --> 49:57.180
How could I not know?

49:59.420 --> 50:00.870
But I'm tired.

50:02.740 --> 50:04.780
When I think about how when the sun rises,

50:04.870 --> 50:05.630
I have to face

50:05.630 --> 50:08.670
the chaos that knows no ends again,

50:09.670 --> 50:10.916
with the soldiers fighting each other,

50:10.940 --> 50:13.240
traps in traps,

50:15.190 --> 50:16.970
I feel sick.

50:18.280 --> 50:19.870
I'll personally order the branches

50:19.870 --> 50:21.420
to disband the soldiers.

50:23.180 --> 50:25.380
But this is the last time I help you.

50:27.020 --> 50:28.470
You're leaving?

50:31.200 --> 50:33.310
You formed an alliance with the court.

50:34.550 --> 50:36.176
When you pacify the rebellion,

50:36.200 --> 50:38.240
you will definitely be recruited by the court.

50:39.670 --> 50:41.400
We have different paths as an official and a bandit.

50:43.710 --> 50:45.980
I'm afraid we can only forget each other.

51:15.230 --> 51:17.030
The only important thing in my life

51:18.130 --> 51:20.300
is my daughter, Mingzhu.

51:20.570 --> 51:22.290
You're wise.

51:22.340 --> 51:26.830
You should have a perfect plan to keep Mingzhu alive.

51:39.740 --> 51:41.810
What's the point of my life?

51:42.100 --> 51:45.310
As long as you're alive, it's meaningful.

52:11.450 --> 52:15.360
♫ It's dark but friends are not back ♫

52:16.440 --> 52:20.650
♫ The night breeze can't understand sadness and heartache ♫

52:21.150 --> 52:24.910
♫ Rain falls all night long and I stay awake ♫

52:26.130 --> 52:30.450
♫ The night rain can't conceal the sorrow ♫

52:30.760 --> 52:35.010
♫ Memory is a book ♫

52:35.500 --> 52:40.120
♫ Who wrote all those stories ♫

52:40.390 --> 52:44.630
♫ Without realizing it ♫

52:45.100 --> 52:49.676
♫ So many years have passed ♫

52:49.700 --> 52:53.580
♫ Flowers fall into the garden ♫

52:53.630 --> 52:58.726
♫ Dear friends, why haven't we met earlier ♫

52:58.750 --> 53:07.430
♫ Destiny is so cruel ♫

53:08.320 --> 53:11.336
♫ The cloud disperses and mountains are seen ♫

53:11.360 --> 53:13.526
♫ How many old friends are gone ♫

53:13.550 --> 53:18.470
♫ I raise my cup to beckon the bright moon ♫

53:18.490 --> 53:20.926
♫ People I miss are thousands of miles away ♫

53:20.950 --> 53:23.236
♫ We let go of the past ♫

53:23.260 --> 53:27.516
♫ Stories take place thousands of miles away ♫

